<title>JAMAICA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 69-1 V INDIA AT LUNCH IN FIRST TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 69-1 V INDIA AT LUNCH IN FIRST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON, Jamaica 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies were 69-1</p>
<p>at lunch on the opening day of the first test in their</p>
<p>five-match series against India at Sabina Park on Thursday.</p>
</text>
